    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n391" root="اخر" body-key="A">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُؤَخَّرٌ</span></b>  The <i>back, hinder,</i> or <i>latter, part</i> of anything: its <i>hindermost,</i> or <i>last, part: contr. of</i>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُقَدَّمٌ</span>: as in the phrase, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ضَرَبَ مُؤَخَّرَ رَأْسِهِ</span> [<i>He
struck the back,</i> or <i>hinder part, of his head</i>].
(S, Msb.) [See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أُخُرٌ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">آخِرٌ</span>.] ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُؤَخَّرُالرَّحْلِ</span>,
and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُؤَخَّرَتُهُ</span>: see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">آخِرٌ</span>.

